    <abstract id="aspace_4d98521c4555b2c0b724b5bb9de68869" label="Abstract">Donald Carl Eugster (aka Carl Eugster, Donald Eugster) is a composer, lyricist, and arranger for musicals and the theater. This collection includes his original scores, announcements of performances, correspondence, programs, and recordings of his work.</abstract>
